      "text": "holy convocation unto you … it is a solemn assembly, Lev. 23:36. eighth day ye shall have a solemn assembly, Num. 29:35 (2 Chr. 7:9; Neh. 8:18). seventh day shall be a solemn assembly, Deut. 16:8. Jehu said, Proclaim a solemn assembly for Baal, 2 Kgs. 10:20. incense is an abomination … even the solemn meeting, Isa. 1:13 (1:10–14). Sanctify ye a fast, call a solemn assembly, Joel 1:14 (2:15; D&C 88:70; 95:7; 109:6; 133:6). I will not smell in your solemn assemblies, Amos 5:21. gather them that are sorrowful for the solemn assembly, Zeph. 3:18.",
